ries. \n\nMatt O'Dowd, host of the popular PBS YouTube Channel Space Time, explores some of the most fascinating questions in astrophysics in a way that everyone can understand.", "short_description": "Space Time takes you to some of the strangest and most beautiful places in the universe to explore astrophysics and the nature of reality. Learn how time bends as you approach the speed of light, how space flows and curves, and approach a black hole to discover it's deadly mysteries."}]}, "developer_name": "Kornhaber Brown", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.youtube.com/pbsspacetime", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.youtube.com/pbsspacetime", "publisher_name": "PBS Digital Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.youtube.com/pbsspacetime", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "SPACE_UNIVERSE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER", "TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "891502371542228"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12410440_173196553307163_6928455935543214080_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1tYooteAeDgQ7kNvwHGjC6h&_nc_oc=AdrZGbuDlC3AeKF9qHpVrFL01FeN-F8nUXDmIxDhz0V4uoPCXRnS0Lpjrs4eHWUUlHQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-bZ8HuTHGvbpBu6LCXaKBIijctPPt_8j4labH-UY5KXg&oe=6A468B9D"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Space Time", "platform": "ANDROID", "context_cate